illing to further education. Those are concerns. So likely we should shift to C. Provide argument referencing Agent 1's points and earlier concerns. Use explicit facts: A difficulty communicating ideas, egocentric, not willing to further education, creates positive atmosphere. C anticipates dangerous situations, sees complex connections, excellent spatial vision, very good leadership, but sometimes not good at taking criticism, unorganized, unfriendly, eats unhealthily. We can argue that C's strengths outweigh concerns, and A's communication and learning issues are more problematic for long-haul. Also both lack stress data, but C's safety-critical strengths are more decisive. So we change vote to Candidate C.\n\nWe must produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE and METADATA_JSON with vote \"Candidate C\". Provide concise argument."}
